@startuml
title Smart Apartment System - Amenities Module (2/3: SLOT MANAGEMENT)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam dpi 75

actor Admin as A
actor Resident as R
participant "Client App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Amenities API" as API
database "Database" as DB

note over A, Gateway: Admin requests include: Authorization: Bearer {admin_token}
note over R, Gateway: Resident requests include: Authorization: Bearer {resident_token}

== ADMIN: CREATE SINGLE SLOT ==

A -> App: Create single slot
App -> Gateway: POST /amenities/{amenityId}/slots\n{slotLabel, slotDate, startTime, endTime, maxCapacity}
Gateway -> API: Forward request
API -> DB: Fetch slot type for the amenity
DB --> API: slotType

alt slotType == 'TIME'
    API -> API: Force maxCapacity = 1
else slotType == 'TIME_COUNT'
    API -> API: Validate maxCapacity >= 1
end

API -> DB: Insert slot (check for duplicate time range)
DB --> API: slot_id
API --> Gateway: 201 Created {slotIds: [id]}
Gateway --> App: Slot created
App --> A: "Slot created successfully"

== ADMIN: CREATE BULK SLOTS ==

A -> App: Create bulk slots
App -> Gateway: POST /amenities/{amenityId}/slots\n{slots: [{slotLabel, slotDate, startTime, endTime, maxCapacity}, ...]}
Gateway -> API: Forward bulk request

loop For each slot in array
    API -> DB: Check for duplicate time range on same date
    DB --> API: No conflict
    alt slotType == 'TIME'
        API -> API: Set maxCapacity = 1
    end
    API -> DB: Insert slot record
    DB --> API: slot_id
end

API --> Gateway: 201 Created {slotIds: [id1, id2], message: "2 slots created"}
Gateway --> App: Bulk slots created
App --> A: "2 slots created successfully"

== ADMIN: UPDATE SLOT ==

A -> App: Update slot details
App -> Gateway: PUT /slots/{slotId}\n{slotLabel, startTime, endTime, maxCapacity, isActive}
Gateway -> API: Forward update request
API -> DB: Fetch slot details with slot type and active booking count
DB --> API: {slotType, activeBookings, maxCapacity}

alt activeBookings == 0
    alt slotType == 'TIME'
        API -> API: Ensure maxCapacity = 1
    else slotType == 'TIME_COUNT'
        API -> API: Validate newMaxCapacity >= activeBookings
    end
    API -> DB: Update slot record
    DB --> API: Updated
    API --> Gateway: 200 OK {message}
    Gateway --> App: Slot updated
    App --> A: "Slot updated successfully"
else activeBookings > 0
    API --> Gateway: 409 Conflict\n"Cannot update slot with active bookings"
    Gateway --> App: Error
    App --> A: "Cannot update: Slot has active bookings"
end

== ADMIN: UPDATE SLOT - CAPACITY REDUCTION FAILURE ==

A -> App: Reduce slot capacity
App -> Gateway: PUT /slots/{slotId} {maxCapacity: 5}
Gateway -> API: Forward request
API -> DB: Fetch slot with current active booking count
DB --> API: {currentBookings: 3, maxCapacity: 10}

alt newMaxCapacity < currentBookings
    API --> Gateway: 409 Conflict\n"Cannot reduce capacity below current bookings (3)"
    Gateway --> App: Error
    App --> A: "Cannot update: Slot has 3 active bookings"
else newMaxCapacity >= currentBookings
    API -> DB: Update slot capacity
    DB --> API: Updated
    API --> Gateway: 200 OK {message}
    Gateway --> App: Success
    App --> A: "Capacity updated successfully"
end

== ADMIN: DELETE SLOT ==

A -> App: Delete slot
App -> Gateway: DELETE /slots/{slotId}
Gateway -> API: Forward request
API -> DB: Check if any bookings exist for this slot
DB --> API: booking_count

alt booking_count == 0
    API -> DB: Delete slot record
    DB --> API: Deleted
    API --> Gateway: 200 OK {message}
    Gateway --> App: Slot deleted
    App --> A: "Slot deleted successfully"
else booking_count > 0
    API --> Gateway: 400 Bad Request\n"Cannot delete slot with existing bookings"
    Gateway --> App: Error
    App --> A: "Cannot delete: Slot has booking history"
end

== ADMIN: VIEW ALL SLOTS ==

A -> App: View all slots for amenity
App -> Gateway: GET /amenities/{amenityId}/slots\n?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&showInactive=true
Gateway -> API: Forward request
API -> DB: Fetch all slots with real-time booking counts
DB --> API: Slots list with booking counts
API --> Gateway: 200 OK {data, pagination}
Gateway --> App: Display slots
App --> A: "Showing slots with booking counts"

== RESIDENT: VIEW AVAILABLE SLOTS ==

R -> App: Browse available slots for a date
App -> Gateway: GET /amenities/{amenityId}/slots/available\n?date=2024-07-20&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Gateway -> API: Forward with role check
API -> DB: Fetch active future slots with current booking counts for the date
DB --> API: Slots with currentBookings per slot

API -> API: Calculate availableSpots per slot\nTIME: availableSpots = 1 - currentBookings\nTIME_COUNT: availableSpots = maxCapacity - currentBookings\nFilter where availableSpots > 0

API --> Gateway: 200 OK {amenityName, slotType, location, rules, slots: [...]}
Gateway --> App: Display available slots
App --> R: "Morning: 7 spots available, Afternoon: 10 spots"

@enduml
